<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Arc outcome title composition pools.
    Each rule key maps to one word or phrase. Multiple rules with the same key
    form a random pool - vanilla GrammarResolver picks one each time.
    Nouns support nesting: [ConceptBadass] etc. all resolve normally.

    successPrefix : word before the noun on success
    failurePrefix : word before the noun on failure
    <NounKey>     : one entry per arc - key matches arcTitleNoun in the epic def
    successSuffix : phrase after the noun on success  (arcUseSuffix = true)
    failureSuffix : phrase after the noun on failure  (arcUseSuffix = true)
    titleSuffix   : shared fallback suffix if outcome pools have no entries

    To add a word: add another <li>key->word</li> entry.
    To remove a word: delete the line.
    No rebuild required - XML-only change.
  -->

